<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 15:48:27 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>亿万富翁 TikTok 创始人现在是亚洲首富，拥有 1050 亿美元的净资产——自 2019 年以来，由于人工智能，他已经增加了 920 亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/billionaire-tiktok-founder-zhang-yiming-richest-person-in-asia-105-billion-net-worth-gained-92-billion-since-2019-ai/</link><description>TikTok母公司字节跳动的创始人张一鸣是亚洲首富——仅本月他的净资产就飙升了120亿美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1263829337-e1789654198399.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 14:24:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/billionaire-tiktok-founder-zhang-yiming-richest-person-in-asia-105-billion-net-worth-gained-92-billion-since-2019-ai/</guid></item><item><title>这家拉斯维加斯赌场刚刚向近万名员工发放了价值超过 7000 万美元的公司股票，以庆祝其 50 岁生日</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/las-vegas-casino-10000-workers-70-million-company-stock-red-rock-resort-spa-fertitta/</link><description>每位符合资格的员工每年在工作期间可获得 1,000 美元的 Red Rock Resorts 股票。一名 1977 年入职的工人拿到了 49,000 美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2294411667-e1789414366177.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 20:20:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/las-vegas-casino-10000-workers-70-million-company-stock-red-rock-resort-spa-fertitta/</guid></item><item><title>男子因诈骗特拉维斯·凯尔斯 3500 万美元的庞氏骗局而被判刑：我“出于贪婪而这样做”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/16/travis-kelce-victim-fraud-ponzi-scheme-sentencing-35-million/</link><description>他还要求在狱中与未婚夫结婚。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2244346396-e1789589503703.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 20:44:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/16/travis-kelce-victim-fraud-ponzi-scheme-sentencing-35-million/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 9 月 16 日的当前油价</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-16-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Price-of-Oil-September-16.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 11:15:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-16-2026/</guid></item><item><title>通用汽车首席执行官玛丽·博拉 (Mary Barra) 表示，美国存在技术行业的“社会问题”，并投入 2 亿美元用于培训 Z 世代用手工作</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/general-motors-ceo-mary-barra-skilled-trades-six-figure-potential-for-gen-z-200-million-investment/</link><description>通用汽车公司去年在技术行业投资了 2 亿美元。其首席执行官玛丽·巴拉 (Mary Barra) 表示，他们可以为 Z 世代提供一条更“不受人工智能影响”的获得六位数薪酬的途径。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2255455069-e1789483585618.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/general-motors-ceo-mary-barra-skilled-trades-six-figure-potential-for-gen-z-200-million-investment/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 9 月 17 日的当前油价</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-17-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Price-of-Oil-September-17.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 12:15:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-17-2026/</guid></item><item><title>随着 Anthropic 的 IPO 规模达到 2 万亿美元，最响亮的批评者之一是公司内部人士</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/anthropic-2-trillion-ipo-critics/</link><description>一位研究人员写道：“如果我们能多出 1% 的机会摆脱困境，我会毫不犹豫地将我的股权烧毁。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2280291162_7519cb-e1789502966344.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 11:48:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/anthropic-2-trillion-ipo-critics/</guid></item><item><title>在加息方面，首席财务官并不指望“一劳永逸”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/fed-rate-hike-cfo-arent-counting-on-one-and-done/</link><description>哥伦比亚经济学家马一鸣表示，真正的风险不是加息本身，而是将其视为一个孤立事件。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295622589.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 11:12:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/fed-rate-hike-cfo-arent-counting-on-one-and-done/</guid></item><item><title>欧洲如何实现其增长潜力？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/how-can-europe-achieve-its-growth-potential-microsoft-volvo-mastercard-logitech-honeywell/</link><description>来自微软、沃尔沃、EDF 和万事达卡的商界领袖概述了欧洲公司面临的挑战和机遇&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/55532646040_b71d5181a2_o-e1789640137646.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 11:29:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/how-can-europe-achieve-its-growth-potential-microsoft-volvo-mastercard-logitech-honeywell/</guid></item><item><title>Zocdoc 首席执行官：我看到沃尔玛、IBM 和其他公司试图“颠覆”医疗保健。这就是他们失败的原因</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/why-healthcare-disruption-fails-zocdoc-ceo/</link><description>长期以来，我们将颠覆误认为是进步。患者仍然很难找到接受保险的医生。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2270866474-e1789578722394.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/why-healthcare-disruption-fails-zocdoc-ceo/</guid></item></channel></rss>